{"id":"fcf536b8-5969-46a6-8695-71b516984ac0","object":"chat.completion","created":1795095615,"model":"deepseek-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"SELECT c.discount_type, ROUND(SUM(cu.discount_amount), 2) AS total_discount_amount\nFROM coupons c\nLEFT JOIN coupon_usages cu ON cu.coupon_id = c.coupon_id\nGROUP BY c.discount_type\nORDER BY c.discount_type\nLIMIT 10;","reasoning_content":"Need query: coupons joined coupon_usages, sum discount_amount grouped by discount_type. \"折扣类型\" — discount_type values fixed/percent. User asks 每种折扣类型. Use coupons.discount_type. Sum coupon_usages.discount_amount. Should we include coupons with no usages? \"优惠券分别带来了多少优惠金额\" — amount from usages; likely sum discount_amount from coupon_usages joined coupons. Using LEFT JOIN to include types with zero? Types are two; question each discount type's discount amount. If no usages, amount 0? Rule: 空缺计数 only explicit; 缺金额不造0. So LEFT JOIN gives NULL. But simpler inner join only types with usages. Hmm \"每种折扣类型\" implies all types present in coupons; but if a type has no usage, no discount amount, likely 0? Rule 9: 聚合粒度, 每指标确定事实全集. \"优惠券带来的优惠金额\" fact is coupon_usages. Types are dimension from coupons. Could left join from coupons to usages and SUM. But then coupon with multiple usages; sum discount_amount. Need not multiply. Group by discount_type. I'd use coupons c LEFT JOIN coupon_usages cu ON ... GROUP BY c.discount_type. SUM(cu.discount_amount) returns NULL for no usage. Alias total_discount_amount. ROUND two decimals. Order? Not asked, maybe order by discount_type or amount desc. Don't add unnecessary. Could order by discount_type. Need LIMIT.\n\nAlternatively \"每种折扣类型的优惠券\" all types, left join. Use ROUND(SUM(cu.discount_amount),2). If no usage, NULL. That's fine per rule. But if no usage, maybe they expect 0? Rule says 缺金额不造0. So NULL.\n\nNeed ensure no duplicate: coupons one row per coupon, usages one per usage. Fine.\n\nSQL:\nSELECT c.discount_type, ROUND(SUM(cu.discount_amount), 2) AS total_discount_amount\nFROM coupons c\nLEFT JOIN coupon_usages cu ON cu.coupon_id = c.coupon_id\nGROUP BY c.discount_type\nORDER BY c.discount_type\nLIMIT 10;\n\nCould filter? \"折扣类型\" no. Don't add. Good.\n\nNeed only SQL no fences. final."},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":2835,"completion_tokens":557,"total_tokens":3392,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":1792},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":489},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":1792,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":1043},"system_fingerprint":"bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}